      "ReportRow": {
        "title": "ReportRow",
        "description": "One player's row of a data-driven report: the identity keys every report carries, then the\nreport's own stat columns, which `columns` names and types. Every value is a number, a string, a\nboolean or `null` — a nested object never appears in a row.",
